{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10284130","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10284130","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1028413001:1":{"text":"どんな感じですか？やはり全身がだるいですか？","source_cn":"你感觉怎么样，也是全身乏力吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCC4E119A837FB249","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1028413002:1":{"text":"僕はこれまでチームで一番たくましい男だった！それが今は、歩くことすらままならない。","source_cn":"你瞧瞧，以前我是队伍里最壮的！现在可好，连走路都累。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x630F770BACA27683","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1028413003:1":{"text":"ハァ、これはいったい何の病気なんだ？ミサタ様、どうか早く僕を元気にしてください。","source_cn":"唉，这到底是什么病啊。弥萨忒在上，赶紧让我好起来吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x13160F6B772B9319","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1028413004:1":{"text":"これは……全身のだるさに、血管が青く浮き出ています……間違いなく腐敗による症状です。","source_cn":"嗯，全身乏力，血管发青……确实是一样的腐化侵蚀症状。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC7472577C74F6574","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"メイメイ","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:采集队员沃尔森":{"text":"採集隊員ワトソン","source":"采集队员沃尔森","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":2}}